  "content": "<p>此模組新增了錘子的更多變體，這是一種將在 Minecraft 1.21 中新增的新武器。</p>\n<p>目前可用：鐵砧錘、烈焰人錘、終界錘、凋靈錘。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/221/anvil_mace.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"361\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/222/nether_mace.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"359\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/278/end_mace.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"363\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/864/787/wither_mace.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"362\"></p>",
